Product Browsing & Search
7. User visits the homepage; React fetches GET /api/products.
8. Spring Boot queries the products table with optional filters (category, brand, price
range).
9. Paginated product list is returned as JSON and rendered by React.
10. User can filter by category, brand, price, or rating in real time.
