Cart & Checkout
11. User clicks 'Add to Cart'; product is stored in React local state / Context.
12. Cart summary shows itemized list with auto-calculated subtotal and GST.
13. User clicks 'Checkout'; React calls POST /api/orders to initiate order.
14. Spring Boot creates an Order record with status PENDING.
15. Razorpay order is created via the Java SDK; payment UI is presented.
16. On payment success, Razorpay sends a webhook to POST /api/payment/verify.
17. Spring Boot verifies the signature, updates order status to PAID and PROCESSING.
18. Stock is decremented in the products table.
19. Order confirmation is returned to the React frontend.
