8. Conclusion
The TechNest system architecture is designed as a scalable, secure, and maintainable
three-tier application. The choice of Java + Spring Boot for the backend brings enterprise-
grade reliability, robust security via Spring Security, and clean data management through
Hibernate JPA. PostgreSQL's relational model ensures data integrity across users, products,
orders, and reviews. The defined process flows, REST API structure, and deployment
strategy provide a clear and complete roadmap for the development phases that follow in
subsequent experiments.